@model FibiEmlakDanismanlik.AdminUI.Models.Content.SiteContentFormViewModel<FibiEmlakDanismanlik.AdminUI.Models.Content.PartnerForm>
@inject FibiEmlakDanismanlik.AdminUI.Infrastructure.SiteImageUrl SiteImageUrl

@{
    var title = Model.IsNew ? "Yeni İş Ortağı" : "İş Ortağını Düzenle";
    ViewData["Title"] = title;

    var errName = Model.GetFieldError("PartnerName");
    var errLogo = Model.GetFieldError("PartnerLogoUrl");
    var errOrder = Model.GetFieldError("DisplayOrder");

    var previewUrl = SiteImageUrl.Preview(Model.Form.PartnerLogoUrl);
}

<div class="pagetitle d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 mb-3">
    <div>
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
            <h1 class="mb-0">@title</h1>
            @if (!Model.IsNew && Model.Form.Id.HasValue)
            {
                <span class="badge bg-secondary-subtle text-secondary border">#@Model.Form.Id.Value</span>
            }
        </div>
        <nav class="mt-1">
            <ol class="breadcrumb mb-0">
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/">Ana Sayfa</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/icerik">İçerik</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item"><a href="/icerik/is-ortaklari">İş Ortakları</a></li>
                <li class="breadcrumb-item active">@title</li>
            </ol>
        </nav>
    </div>
    <div>
        <a href="/icerik/is-ortaklari" class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm">
            <i class="bi bi-arrow-left me-1"></i> İş Ortaklarına Dön
        </a>
    </div>
</div>

@if (TempData["Success"] != null)
{
    <div class="alert alert-success alert-dismissible fade show d-flex align-items-center mb-4" role="alert">
        <i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill flex-shrink-0 me-2 fs-5"></i>
        <div>@TempData["Success"]</div>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Kapat"></button>
    </div>
}

@if (TempData["Error"] != null)
{
    <div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible fade show d-flex align-items-center mb-4" role="alert">
        <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill flex-shrink-0 me-2 fs-5"></i>
        <div>@TempData["Error"]</div>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Kapat"></button>
    </div>
}

@if (!string.IsNullOrWhiteSpace(Model.ErrorMessage))
{
    <div class="alert alert-danger alert-dismissible fade show d-flex align-items-center mb-4" role="alert">
        <i class="bi bi-exclamation-triangle-fill flex-shrink-0 me-2 fs-5"></i>
        <div>@Model.ErrorMessage</div>
        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="alert" aria-label="Kapat"></button>
    </div>
}

<partial name="_ContentNav" model="@("is-ortaklari")" />

<form method="post" action="@(Model.IsNew ? "/icerik/is-ortaklari/yeni" : $"/icerik/is-ortaklari/{Model.Form.Id}")">
    @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
    @if (!Model.IsNew)
    {
        <input type="hidden" name="Id" value="@Model.Form.Id" />
    }

    <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-lg-8 col-12">
            <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4">
                <div class="card-body pt-3">
                    <h5 class="card-title p-0 pb-2 border-bottom mb-3">
                        <i class="bi bi-building me-2 text-primary"></i>İş Ortağı Bilgileri
                    </h5>

                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="PartnerName" class="form-label small fw-semibold">
                            Firma Adı <span class="text-danger">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <input type="text"
                               class="form-control @(errName != null ? "is-invalid" : "")"
                               id="PartnerName"
                               name="PartnerName"
                               value="@Model.Form.PartnerName"
                               placeholder="Örn: Garanti BBVA, Emlak Konut, Yapı Kredi"
                               required />
                        @if (errName != null)
                        {
                            <div class="invalid-feedback d-block">@errName</div>
                        }
                    </div>

                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="PartnerLogoUrl" class="form-label small fw-semibold">
                            Logo Adresi (URL / Yol) <span class="text-danger">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <input type="text"
                               class="form-control @(errLogo != null ? "is-invalid" : "")"
                               id="PartnerLogoUrl" data-help="Site içi yol (/...) veya https adresi girilebilir ya da Bilgisayardan yükle ile eklenebilir."
                               name="PartnerLogoUrl"
                               value="@Model.Form.PartnerLogoUrl"
                               placeholder="https://... veya /uploads/partner/..."
                               required />
                        @if (errLogo != null)
                        {
                            <div class="invalid-feedback d-block">@errLogo</div>
                        }

                        <div class="mt-2"
                             data-image-upload
                             data-target="PartnerLogoUrl"
                             data-folder="partner"
                             data-preview="partnerLogoPreview"></div>

                        <div class="form-text text-muted mt-2">
                            <i class="bi bi-info-circle me-1"></i>Önerilen logo boyutu 180×70 px, şeffaf PNG.
                        </div>

                        <div class="mt-3 p-3 bg-light rounded border text-center d-inline-block" style="min-width: 200px;">
                            <div class="small text-muted mb-2 fw-semibold">Logo Önizleme:</div>
                            <img id="partnerLogoPreview"
                                 src="@(previewUrl ?? "")"
                                 alt="@(Model.Form.PartnerName ?? "Logo Önizleme")"
                                 class="p-1 @(string.IsNullOrEmpty(previewUrl) ? "d-none" : "")"
                                 style="max-height: 70px; max-width: 180px; object-fit: contain;" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-4 col-12">
            <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4">
                <div class="card-body pt-3">
                    <h5 class="card-title p-0 pb-2 border-bottom mb-3">
                        <i class="bi bi-sliders me-2 text-primary"></i>Yayın Ayarları
                    </h5>

                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label for="DisplayOrder" class="form-label small fw-semibold">
                            Sıralama
                        </label>
                        <input type="number"
                               class="form-control @(errOrder != null ? "is-invalid" : "")"
                               id="DisplayOrder" data-help="İş ortakları şeridinde logonun gösterim sırasıdır (küçük sayılar daha önce listelenir)."
                               name="DisplayOrder"
                               value="@Model.Form.DisplayOrder"
                               min="0" />
                        <div class="form-text">
                            Küçük sayılar sayfada daha önce listelenir.
                        </div>
                        @if (errOrder != null)
                        {
                            <div class="invalid-feedback d-block">@errOrder</div>
                        }
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-check form-switch pt-2 border-top mb-1">
                        <input type="checkbox"
                               class="form-check-input"
                               id="IsActive" data-help="İşaretlendiğinde iş ortağı logosu sitedeki iş ortakları alanında ziyaretçilere gösterilir."
                               name="IsActive"
                               value="true"
                               @(Model.Form.IsActive ? "checked" : "") />
                        <input type="hidden" name="IsActive" value="false" />
                        <label class="form-check-label small fw-semibold" for="IsActive">
                            Sitede göster
                        </label>
                        <div class="form-text">
                            Açık olduğunda logo web sitesinde iş ortakları alanında gösterilir.
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 mb-4">
                <div class="card-body p-3">
                    <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="bi bi-check-lg me-1"></i> Kaydet
                        </button>
                        <a href="/icerik/is-ortaklari" class="btn btn-outline-secondary">
                            Vazgeç
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            @if (!Model.IsNew && Model.Form.Id.HasValue)
            {
                <div class="card shadow-sm border-0 border-danger-subtle">
                    <div class="card-body p-3">
                        <details class="text-start">
                            <summary class="text-danger fw-semibold" style="cursor: pointer;">
                                <i class="bi bi-trash me-1"></i> Bu iş ortağını sil
                            </summary>
                            <div class="pt-3">
                                <p class="text-muted small mb-3">
                                    Bu iş ortağını sildiğinizde işlem geri alınamaz. Devam etmek istediğinize emin misiniz?
                                </p>
                                <button type="submit"
                                        form="deleteForm"
                                        class="btn btn-danger btn-sm w-100">
                                    <i class="bi bi-trash me-1"></i> Kalıcı olarak sil
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </details>
                    </div>
                </div>
            }
        </div>
    </div>
</form>

@if (!Model.IsNew && Model.Form.Id.HasValue)
{
    <form id="deleteForm"
          method="post"
          action="/icerik/is-ortaklari/@Model.Form.Id.Value/sil"
          data-confirm="«@(Model.Form.PartnerName)» iş ortağı silinsin mi? Bu işlem geri alınamaz."
          class="d-none">
        @Html.AntiForgeryToken()
    </form>
}

@section Scripts {
    <script src="~/js/image-upload.js" asp-append-version="true"></script>
}
